  notes: >-
    ESTIF v6.3 — the gravitational field equation is derived from the flow axioms
    (mass continuity = Poisson) via Gauss-Codazzi, giving exact Schwarzschild in
    vacuum and Newtonian rho0 for a source, with no Poisson postulate and no
    match to the Schwarzschild solution; the matter coupling (8*pi*G) is adopted,
    not derived. The cosmology circularity is fixed (self-consistent x(z)); the frozen-eddy limit
    (w=-1) ties LCDM on DESI DR2 (chi^2/N = 1.92) and the Omega_tilt apparatus is
    retired. The project splits into Path One (Core, clean) and Path Two
    (Extended, hard). Run: python3 tests/estif_task4_field_equation.py
